## Interface: 11200
## Title: |cffffffffUnreal|cfff5ae0a Quest
## Notes: Quest helper for the Unreal Azeroth client. A movable quest tracker and service-NPC selector, current-zone world-map pins, minimap pins, quest tracking and entity tooltips. A quest navigator arc and arrow point the way to the quest you are following, and a second one to a tracked creature - see docs/HUD-NAVIGATOR.md.
## Author: unrealQuest
## Version: 0.3.3
## X-License: MIT. Bundled world data from pfQuest (MIT), sourced from VMaNGOS. See LICENSE.
